title: 'A small public front door for the bus'
summary: 'The first public page keeps the project status, next work session, needs, and contact path in one place.'
tags:
  - website
  - build
published: true
---

Today we put the public story in one small place: what the Great Falls Tool Bus
is, what is happening next, and how neighbors can help.

The bus itself is still in preparation. Current hands-on work centers on keeping
water out, measuring unusual openings, clearing and preparing the interior, and
planning an interim lock. We are not lending tools or taking online membership
payments yet.

This page will change through short, reviewed updates. The useful test is
simple: a neighbor should be able to tell what is real today and what they can
do next without learning our internal planning system.
